---
import BuySection from './BuySection.astro';
import TodoMeme from './TodoMeme.astro';
import Referral from './Referral.astro';
const IMG = '/illustrations';
const CITIES = [
  { name: 'New York', flag: '🇺🇸', tz: 'America/New_York' },
  { name: 'São Paulo', flag: '🇧🇷', tz: 'America/Sao_Paulo' },
  { name: 'London', flag: '🇬🇧', tz: 'Europe/London' },
  { name: 'Barcelona', flag: '🇪🇸', tz: 'Europe/Madrid' },
  { name: 'Cluj-Napoca', flag: '🇷🇴', tz: 'Europe/Bucharest' },
  { name: 'Dubai', flag: '🇦🇪', tz: 'Asia/Dubai' },
  { name: 'Mumbai', flag: '🇮🇳', tz: 'Asia/Kolkata' },
  { name: 'Shanghai', flag: '🇨🇳', tz: 'Asia/Shanghai' },
  { name: 'Tokyo', flag: '🇯🇵', tz: 'Asia/Tokyo' },
];
const CA = 'Ab16ce5SDbibTbXevxHLpqUnUvu9tNkkpaJcSDvCpump';
const PUMP = `https://pump.fun/coin/${CA}`;
const TG = 'https://t.me/ZAPP369';
const short = CA.slice(0, 4) + '…' + CA.slice(-4);
---
<div id="dim-present" class="page present-classic">
  <canvas id="present-canvas"></canvas>
  <div class="p-hero pz-hero">
    <img class="pz-mascot rv" src="/img/zapp-mascot.png" alt="⚡ZAPP mascot" width="200" height="200" />
    <h1 class="pz-word rv d1">ZAPP<span class="pz-bolt">⚡</span></h1>
    <p class="pz-eq rv d1">Free Energy = Free Money</p>
    <div class="pz-inf rv d2">∞</div>
    <blockquote class="pz-quote rv d2">"If you knew the magnificence of <em>3, 6 and 9</em>, you would have a key to the <em>universe</em>."<cite>— Nikola Tesla</cite></blockquote>
    <div class="pz-btns rv d3">
      <a class="pz-buy" href={PUMP} target="_blank" rel="noopener">⚡ Buy ZAPP</a>
      <a class="pz-ghost" href={TG} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Socials</a>
      <a class="pz-ghost" href="/whitepaper" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Whitepaper</a>
    </div>
    <p class="pz-silence rv d3">— The Frequency They Tried To Silence —</p>
    <button class="pz-ca rv d3" type="button" data-copy-ca><span class="pz-ca-l">Contract · Solana</span><span class="pz-ca-a">{short}</span><span class="pz-ca-c">Copy</span></button>
    <div id="ca-msg" class="pz-msg"></div>
    <div class="price-hud rv d4">
      <div class="ph-cell"><div class="ph-l"><span class="ph-n">3</span> ⚡ZAPP Price</div><div class="ph-v" id="p-price">—</div></div>
      <div class="ph-cell"><div class="ph-l"><span class="ph-n">6</span> Market Cap</div><div class="ph-v" id="p-mcap">—</div></div>
      <div class="ph-cell"><div class="ph-l"><span class="ph-n">9</span> The Frequency</div><div class="ph-v ph-freq">3 · 6 · 9 · ∞</div></div>
    </div>
    <TodoMeme />
  </div>
  <div class="vbar rv"><div class="vi"><span class="vd"></span>Mint Revoked</div><div class="vi"><span class="vd"></span>LP Burned</div><div class="vi"><span class="vd"></span>Freeze Revoked</div></div>
  <!-- ⚡ WHY ZAPP — manifesto -->
  <section class="manifesto">
    <h2 class="mf-title rv">Why <span class="mf-zap">⚡ZAPP</span>?</h2>
    <div class="mf-lines">
      <p class="rv">Money is energy.</p>
      <p class="rv">Energy travels at the speed of light.</p>
      <p class="rv">So why does it still take <em>days</em> to reach Africa, Asia, the Americas?</p>
      <p class="rv">One idea: <em>free energy should mean free money</em>.</p>
      <p class="rv">No banks. No borders.</p>
      <p class="rv">Zapped instantly to anyone, anywhere on Earth.</p>
      <p class="rv">Tesla understood this a century ago.</p>
      <p class="rv">The code was always there — hidden in plain sight.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="mf-tag rv">One Frequency · One Signal · One World</p>
  </section>
  <!-- 🌍 WORLD CLOCK — the frequency reaches every time zone -->
  <section class="worldclock rv">
    <p class="wc-eyebrow">The signal reaches every time zone</p>
    <h2 class="wc-title">⚡ One frequency. <em>One world.</em></h2>
    <div class="wc-grid" id="wc-grid">
      {CITIES.map(c => (
        <div class="wc-c" data-tz={c.tz}>
          <div class="wc-top"><span class="wc-flag">{c.flag}</span><span class="wc-city">{c.name}</span><span class="wc-ic" aria-hidden="true">☀️</span></div>
          <div class="wc-time">--:--:--</div>
          <div class="wc-day">—</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="wc-note">⚡ Tesla's frequency reaches every time zone — at the speed of light.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="p-scenes">
    <div class="p-row rv"><div class="p-img"><img src={`${IMG}/not-just-memecoin.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='rgba(13,34,51,.3)'"></div><div><p class="p-kicker">The Difference</p><h3 class="p-h3">Not just <em>another memecoin</em>.</h3><p class="p-p">Doge had a meme. Pepe had a cult. ⚡ZAPP has 130 years of suppressed history and a frequency that was always meant to reach everyone.</p></div></div>
    <div class="p-row flip rv"><div class="p-img"><img src={`${IMG}/vault-v2.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='rgba(13,34,51,.3)'"></div><div><p class="p-kicker">Trust On-Chain</p><h3 class="p-h3">Nobody touches<br>the <em>liquidity</em>.</h3><p class="p-p">LP permanently burned. Mint revoked. Freeze revoked. 0% tax. The vault is sealed — not even the founders can open it.</p></div></div>
    <div class="p-row rv"><div class="p-img"><img src={`${IMG}/369-cards.jpg`} alt="Liquidity locked — protected by the 3·6·9 curve" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='rgba(13,34,51,.3)'"></div><div><p class="p-kicker">The Curve · 3 · 6 · 9</p><h3 class="p-h3">Protected by<br>the <em>curve</em>.</h3><p class="p-p">Liquidity locked behind the 3·6·9 bonding curve. Nobody touches it — not even us. The geometry holds the line so the signal can't be pulled.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="calc-outer rv"><div class="calc-inner"><h3>⚡ Your ZAPP, measured</h3><p class="sub">Enter your holdings — see the live value</p><div class="calc-row"><input type="text" id="cin" placeholder="1,000,000" inputmode="numeric"><span class="unit">⚡ZAPP</span></div><div class="presets"><button data-sc="100000">100K</button><button data-sc="1000000">1M</button><button data-sc="10000000">10M</button><button data-sc="100000000">100M</button><button data-sc="1000000000">1B</button></div><div class="calc-out"><span class="co-l">Value at live price</span><span class="co-v" id="cout">—</span></div><p class="calc-note">Not financial advice. ZAPP can go to zero.</p></div></div>
  <div class="hof rv"><div class="hof-head"><h2>Pump.fun Hall of Fame</h2><p>The six that made it out — from the same starting line</p></div><div class="hof-g"><div class="hc"><div class="rk">No.1</div><div class="nm">FARTCOIN</div><div class="mc">$2.15B</div><div class="dc">AI dreamed it. Colbert mentioned it.</div></div><div class="hc"><div class="rk">No.2</div><div class="nm">PNUT</div><div class="mc">$1.8B</div><div class="dc">A real squirrel. A real news cycle.</div></div><div class="hc"><div class="rk">No.3</div><div class="nm">GOAT</div><div class="mc">$1.3B</div><div class="dc">AI prophecy. Truth Terminal cult.</div></div><div class="hc"><div class="rk">No.4</div><div class="nm">CHILLGUY</div><div class="mc">$543M</div><div class="dc">TikTok generation. Pure vibe.</div></div><div class="hc"><div class="rk">No.5</div><div class="nm">MOTHER</div><div class="mc">$200M</div><div class="dc">Iggy Azalea launched it.</div></div><div class="hc zapp"><div class="rk">⚡ ZAPP</div><div class="nm" id="zv">Live</div><div class="mc">3 · 6 · 9 ∞</div><div class="dc">Tesla's frequency. Now on Solana.</div></div></div></div>
  <!-- ☀️ SUMMER · FREE-ENERGY SECTION inside Present -->
  <div style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5C3E1A 0%,#3E2A10 55%,#271A08 100%);position:relative;z-index:2;padding:5rem 2rem 6rem;text-align:center">
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto">
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8C07A;margin-bottom:1.5rem;opacity:.95" class="rv">☀️ · Summer Edition · Free Energy</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem);font-weight:700;line-height:.92;color:#F8EBD0;margin-bottom:1rem" class="rv d1"><em style="color:#F4D27A;font-style:italic">Cool</em> Head.<br>Diamond Hold.</h2>
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.35em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(248,235,208,.55);margin-bottom:1rem" class="rv d2">SUN ON MY BACK · DIAMONDS IN MY WALLET</p>
      <p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.1rem;color:rgba(248,235,208,.7);margin-bottom:3rem;max-width:40ch;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.8" class="rv d3">The brightest movement on Solana. HODL · CHILL · EARN · REPEAT</p>
      <div class="cold-grid rv d3">
        <div class="cold-c">
          <div class="cold-ic">☀️</div>
          <h3>Bright</h3>
          <p>Long days, steady hands. Built for the long run.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cold-c">
          <div class="cold-ic">🔒</div>
          <h3>Locked</h3>
          <p>Burned. Sealed. Untouchable. Not even us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cold-c">
          <div class="cold-ic">💎</div>
          <h3>Diamond</h3>
          <p>Sun on the skin. Diamonds in the wallet. Forever.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- 🛒 HOW TO BUY -->
  <section class="howto rv">
    <p class="ht-eyebrow">From zero to ⚡ZAPP — four steps</p>
    <h2 class="ht-title">How to <em>hold the frequency</em>.</h2>
    <div class="ht-steps">
      <div class="ht-step"><span class="ht-n">1</span><div><h3>Get a Solana wallet</h3><p>Install <strong>Phantom</strong> (phantom.com) on your phone or browser — 60 seconds. Save your seed phrase. Never share it with anyone.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ht-step"><span class="ht-n">2</span><div><h3>Fund it with SOL</h3><p>Buy SOL inside Phantom with a card, or send it from any exchange (Coinbase, Binance). A few dollars is enough to start.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ht-step"><span class="ht-n">3</span><div><h3>Swap SOL for ⚡ZAPP</h3><p>Open <strong>Pump.fun</strong> or <strong>Jupiter</strong>, paste the contract address below, and swap. If it fails, raise slippage to ~5%.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ht-step"><span class="ht-n">4</span><div><h3>Hold the frequency</h3><p>That's it — you're holding for Tesla now. Keep your keys, keep the faith. <strong>3 · 6 · 9 · ∞</strong></p></div></div>
    </div>
    <button class="ht-cta" data-scroll-buy>⚡ Get ⚡ZAPP — contract &amp; links below ↓</button>
  </section>

  <Referral />

  <!-- 🕯️ THE REASON TO HOLD — like Hachiko at the station, we hold for the man who gave it all away -->
  <section class="hold-memorial">
    <div class="hm-inner">
      <p class="hm-eyebrow rv">In His Memory · 1856 – 1943</p>
      <h2 class="hm-h rv d1">We hold the line<br>for the man who <em>let go</em>.</h2>
      <p class="hm-p rv d2">Tesla died alone in a New York hotel room — broke, feeding pigeons with the last coins in his pocket, still holding a frequency the world wasn't ready for.</p>
      <p class="hm-p rv d2">Like the dog who waited at the station long after his master was gone, we hold. Not for the chart — for <em>him</em>.</p>
      <p class="hm-line rv d3">Every hand that holds ⚡ZAPP keeps his idea alive: <em>free energy, free money</em> — given away so it could belong to everyone.</p>
      <p class="hm-sign rv d3">⚡ Hold his frequency · 3 · 6 · 9 · ∞</p>
      <button class="btn-hold rv d3" data-hub>↩ Back to the Hub</button>
    </div>
  </section>
  <BuySection sub="Live on Solana. Community owned." disc="Not financial advice. 3 · 6 · 9 ∞" showMsg={false} />
</div>
